        "created_at": "2015-02-19T06:16:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was just watching the PAX south tournament on youtube and I saw something that raised a question. It's probably been asked before but I couldn't find it in the forum anywhere.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So, with Pushing the Limits, can you keep taking 1 damage to keep taking turns? Allowing a full Health tachyon to have a total of 4 turns before another player can act? My gut says no, but the cards seem to say yes.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:50.486Z",
