        "raw": "<p>I was just watching the PAX south tournament on youtube and I saw something that raised a question. It&#39;s probably been asked before but I couldn&#39;t find it in the forum anywhere.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So, with Pushing the Limits, can you keep taking 1 damage to keep taking turns? Allowing a full Health tachyon to have a total of 4 turns before another player can act? My gut says no, but the cards seem to say yes.</p>",
